    "Number 1111 1111 in the binary system corresponds to 15 15 in the decimal system.",
    "The two's complement of a negative number in binary is achieved by switching all digits of the opposite positive number to opposite bit values and adding 1 to the number.",
    "We want to convert the number − 87 −87 in the decimal system into an 8-bit binary system.",
    "Find the binary representation of the positive number 87 87 in the decimal system: 0101 0111 0101 0111.",
    "For example, we will transform the number -87 from the decimal to the binary system.",
    "The calculator displays the result: The binary value of the positive opposite of our number, so 87 87, is: 0101 0111 0101 0111."
